'''Altaneu Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport d'Altaneu}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: ALT, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: ALIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Altaneu]], a city in [[Jala Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located in the Jala highlands and is jet-capable. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]] from [[Sant Cristòfor International Airport|Sant Cristòfor]] and by [[RapidAir (Balboa)|RapidAir]].

